@display("std/ws")
ws: component(path = "std/ws", lang = "heron") {
  | Binds apis and ops to WebSockets, each op a message type on the socket.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/ws/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export | Specified in                                |
  | | ------ | ------------------------------------------- |
  | | `@ws`  | [Streams](#language.apis.streams.ws_socket) |

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
